PROPERTIES OF THE PRIOR AND THE ENSEMBLE (fit-independent — not results)
  d=6: prior median 10.08  |  prior MODE 0.5016 = the MAP attractor AND the kernel's initialisation  |  lengthscale floor 0.025
        true active feature width (censored FWHM) 0.739; prior mode / width 0.68
  d=8: prior median 11.63  |  prior MODE 0.5792 = the MAP attractor AND the kernel's initialisation  |  lengthscale floor 0.025
